WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,240
Breakthrough a month ago

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,240
I wanted to tell my senior sister

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,240
Got busy and forgot

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,240
Just in time to return it to you today

5
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,240
When this mausoleum road is in my hands

6
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,240
Just two quarters

7
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,240
Following you, I broke through

8
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,240
You keep it

9
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,240
I have Xia Yunmon

10
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,240
He's of no use to me anymore

11
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,070
How can this be embarrassing to me?

12
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,070
If you insist on counting

13
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:20,070
Just treat it like you bought it

14
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,070
I still owe you

15
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,070
Twenty-eight gold coins?

16
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,070
Just get there from there

17
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:27,380
Then thank you very much, sister.

18
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,500
Stop dawdling

19
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,500
It wasted a lot of time again

20
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,500
Master, you've been waiting for a long time, Master

21
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:57,840
I brought Junior Brother Chu back
